note contract 6 lines 177-178: two parts of one array in one call are error 19, whatever their
note ranges (here disjoint 0..1 and 5..6).
om2
fn two x view uchar * y view uchar * to ulong
ret add len x len y
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 0
putd two part a 0 2 part a 5 2
ret 0
end
